3. Add `<Analytics />` component to app root ✅

## Deployment Notes
- Analytics tracking will begin automatically once the app is deployed to Vercel
- No additional configuration is required in Vercel dashboard
- The component works in both development and production modes
- Data will appear in the Vercel Analytics dashboard after deployment

